<div class="source-doc-poem">
  <p>
    Our Faith is such, that we are sure;<br>
    That on that great and glorious Day.<br>
    When at the bidding of our Lord;<br>
    Cloud's break, and shadows flee away.<br>
    And we have reached the other Shore;<br>
    And stand on that Celestial Plain<br>
    Among the Throngs that greet us there;<br>
    We will see and know, our Boy again.
  </p>
